  "details": "As I load into VRChat, everything seems normal. I load into my world and avatar normally. However, after world-hopping and chilling with friends, someone changes an avatar, and it becomes an error. I try hiding and showing the avatar, but it becomes an error again. This problem persists for a few minutes, and then it goes back to normal. Then, it comes back a few minutes later. This problem has been happening for the past few weeks. so far I have not seen much mention of the issue and it seems like the new verification system made the problem worse. after creating a Bug report log and looking at the events I noticed the errors were saying Missing credentials and aborting the request codes. I'm not sure if its a timeout from an unresponsive server or the bug is preventing credentials from being read ut the result is still the same. i attached the Bug report below",
